  "description": "Step into a peaceful woodland scene with Rustic Forest Critters — a cozy collection of 15 seamless repeat patterns featuring a delightful mix of forest animals and autumn charm. You’ll find sweet foxes, deer, squirrels, rabbits, hedgehogs, and robins nestled among falling leaves, earthy stripes, and classic plaid — all in a warm palette of deep green, burnt orange, and golden brown.\nThese high-resolution designs are perfect for fall-themed scrapbooking, nursery decor, party invitations, fabric prints, sublimation, and cozy seasonal crafts. The seamless quality makes them ideal for both small details and large backgrounds.\n🍁 What’s Included:\n🍂15 seamless patterns\n🍂High-resolution JPGs (4000×4000 px, 300 DPI)\n🍂Bonus Photoshop .PAT file for effortless use\nPerfect for crafters, designers, and nature lovers who want to capture the rustic magic of autumn in every project! 🌲🦌🍂",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into a peaceful woodland scene with Rustic Forest Critters — a cozy collection of 15 seamless repeat patterns featuring a delightful mix of forest animals and autumn charm. You’ll find sweet foxes, deer, squirrels, rabbits, hedgehogs, and robins nestled among falling leaves, earthy stripes, and classic plaid — all in a warm palette of deep green, burnt orange, and golden brown.</p>\n<p>These high-resolution designs are perfect for fall-themed scrapbooking, nursery decor, party invitations, fabric prints, sublimation, and cozy seasonal crafts. The seamless quality makes them ideal for both small details and large backgrounds.</p>\n<p>🍁 What’s Included:<br>\n🍂15 seamless patterns<br>\n🍂High-resolution JPGs (4000×4000 px, 300 DPI)<br>\n🍂Bonus Photoshop .PAT file for effortless use</p>\n<p>Perfect for crafters, designers, and nature lovers who want to capture the rustic magic of autumn in every project! 🌲🦌🍂</p>",
